Missed-Call Trigger System (MacroDroid + Android Phone + VAPI + Twilio)

This approach is actually very smart for low-cost deployments in India because:

User gives a missed call
Android phone detects incoming call using MacroDroid
Phone automatically disconnects
Your automation server triggers VAPI outbound AI call
Twilio/VAPI calls customer back

This removes:

Web form dependency
Manual lead entry
Expensive inbound IVR setup
Complex frontend/backend for basic triggering

It becomes a “Missed Call AI Callback System.”

