Core Concept
Flow
Step 1 — User Gives Missed Call

Customer calls your number:

+91 98XXXXXX12

Phone rings for 1–2 seconds.

Step 2 — MacroDroid Detects Call

MacroDroid automation:

Trigger:
Incoming Call

Actions:
1. Capture caller number
2. Reject call
3. Send HTTP request to local server
Step 3 — Local Server Receives Number

Example payload:

{
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-22T10:00:00Z"
}
Step 4 — Server Triggers Make.com

Node.js server sends webhook:

POST → Make.com webhook
Step 5 — Make.com Starts Workflow

Workflow:

Webhook
   ↓
Check duplicate calls
   ↓
Store in Supabase
   ↓
Format VAPI payload
   ↓
HTTP request to VAPI
